#   consTimeTo   - 截止日期 yyyyMMdd (必填)
GET {{aws_host}}/aws/api?option=getMaterialConsumption&plant={{plant}}&machineId={{machineId}}&workOrderNo=&materialNo=&consTimeFrom=20190301&consTimeTo=20260302
